<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-KALEV Q2 NET PROFIT 4.3 MILLION KROONS.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-KALEV Q2 NET PROFIT 4.3 MILLION KROONS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second quarter 1997</p>
<p>					(million kroons unless stated)</p>
<p> Net profit				   4.3  vs  0.7</p>
<p> Turnover				    84.2  vs 68.8</p>
<p>Note: Kalev confectionery is traded on the free</p>
